comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-25T05:11:35.408Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for Skills over MCP skill discovery progressive disclosure capability requirements version coherence and token budgets. pm-z3ez owns distribution but not the MCP extension protocol."
body: "## Skill contract\n\n- Discover skill identity, version, purpose, required capabilities, supported surfaces, input contract, output budget, and linked runtime commands.\n- Fetch brief, standard, deep, or exact referenced sections on demand.\n- Bind skill compatibility to pm package version, MCP protocol version, active extensions, and contract schema version.\n- Generate or validate command examples against live contracts and execute negative controls in CI.\n- Preserve repository-local overrides with explicit provenance and precedence.\n- Measure tokens loaded, steps completed, refusal recovery, and stale-guidance escapes."
